DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
8473::$$$message_0061_0000_0000$$$::Before we go into winter, I finish inspecting the heater that wasn't working and go back to the student council room.[lr]::
8474::$$$message_0061_0000_0001$$$::I would usually be with Issei, but it seems like he has some student council work, so I was going around by myself.::
8475::$$$message_0061_0001_0000$$$::"Hey Issei, I mostly fini[line len=2]"[lr]::
8476::$$$message_0061_0001_0001$$$::When I open the door, there's Issei and Mitsuzuri inside.[lr]::
8477::$$$message_0061_0001_0002$$$::"...shed, but..."[lr]::
8478::$$$message_0061_0001_0003$$$::...Hm. This combination is rare, but it's also rare that they're sitting close enough to each other that their shoulders are touching.::
8479::$$$message_0061_0002_0000$$$::A saving hand reaches out to my frozen mind. She looked like a devil in red clothes, but I don't care at this point. I would even grab a straw while drowning.[lr]::
8480::$$$message_0061_0002_0001$$$::"Look, Shirou. Those who interfere with the romance of others can't die even if they're kicked by a horse. But the pain still remains."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
8481::$$$message_0061_0002_0002$$$::[movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 time=600 pos=l accel=2 storage=凛私服04a(近)]That's brutal. It depends on the time and place, but I wish I could be allowed to die if I have a fatal injury.[wm canskip=0][clfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服04a(近) time=10]::
8482::$$$message_0061_0003_0000$$$::"Sorry for interrupting."::
8483::$$$message_0061_0004_0000$$$::I obey the revelation and close the door.::
8484::$$$message_0061_0005_0000$$$::"...Phew, that was close. Man, I didn't think Issei and Mitsuzuri were like that."::
8485::$$$message_0061_0006_0000$$$::Well, those two wouldn't make any mistakes.[lr]::
8486::$$$message_0061_0006_0001$$$::I feel my stomach drop [sestop storage=se422.wav time=1000 nowait=true][se storage=se021 nowait=true]and I just want to go straight home.::
8487::$$$message_0061_0007_0000$$$::"Hold on, Emiya! Where are you planning on going!?"[lr]::
8488::$$$message_0061_0007_0001$$$::"Well. I was thinking of going home, since I finished what you asked me to do."[lr]::
8489::$$$message_0061_0007_0002$$$::"Haha, Emiya. [cacheimage storage=美綴01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=1000][chgfg time=300 storage=美綴01c(中)]Just come back over here."[lr]::
8490::$$$message_0061_0007_0003$$$::"Huh? But, aren't I interrupting?"[lr]::
8491::$$$message_0061_0007_0004$$$::"Shut up, no buts."[lr]::
8492::$$$message_0061_0007_0005$$$::"Wait, what?"::
8493::$$$message_0061_0008_0000$$$::The two of them drag me[se storage=se021 nowait=true] back to the student council room.::
8494::$$$message_0061_0009_0000$$$::"...Oh, so it was a misunderstanding.[lr]::
8495::$$$message_0061_0009_0001$$$::You should've just said so."[lr]::
8496::$$$message_0061_0009_0002$$$::"Before we could, you're the one who went out still misunderstanding. Reflect on it."[lr]::
8497::$$$message_0061_0009_0003$$$::"...Mrgh. So it's my fault."::
8498::$$$message_0061_0010_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=美綴01a(中) textoff=0]Mitsuzuri looks like she's smiling, but she's not smiling at all deep down.[lr]::
8499::$$$message_0061_0010_0001$$$::It must be because they're friends, but she's similar to Tohsaka.[lr]::
8500::$$$message_0061_0010_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成01c(中) textoff=0]...I feel like Sakura has also been smiling the same way lately.[lr]::
8501::$$$message_0061_0010_0003$$$::It must also be because they're siblings that she's starting to be similar to Tohsaka.::
8502::$$$message_0061_0011_0000$$$::"...Is there just going to be a bunch of Tohsakas around me?"[lr]::
8503::$$$message_0061_0011_0001$$$::"What kind of ominous thing are you muttering about with a serious face?"[lr]::
8504::$$$message_0061_0011_0002$$$::"Yeah, I also think that would be the end of the world.[lr]::
8505::$$$message_0061_0011_0003$$$::...So. What are you guys doing?"::
8506::$$$message_0061_0012_0000$$$::...Then.[lr]::
8507::$$$message_0061_0012_0001$$$::When I look closely, there's a large amount of documents laid out on the desk.[lr]::
8508::$$$message_0061_0012_0002$$$::It looks like they were having some kind of meeting...?::
8509::$$$message_0061_0013_0000$$$::"We were having a meeting for the cultural festival."[lr]::
8510::$$$message_0061_0013_0001$$$::"Oh, I see.[lr]::
8511::$$$message_0061_0013_0002$$$::But why is Mitsuzuri with you? Is there some problem with the kyudo club?"[lr]::
8512::$$$message_0061_0013_0003$$$::"It's because I'm a cultural festival executive committee member."[lr]::
8513::$$$message_0061_0013_0004$$$::"Oh, really?"::
8514::$$$message_0061_0014_0000$$$::The two of them sigh at my response.::
8515::$$$message_0061_0015_0000$$$::"By the way, you probably don't remember at this rate, but you're one of the executive committee members too."[lr]::
8516::$$$message_0061_0015_0001$$$::"...My bad. [cacheimage storage=一成01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成01c(中) textoff=0]I totally forgot."[lr]::
8517::$$$message_0061_0015_0002$$$::"Well, we haven't started any activities yet, so it's all right."[lr]::
8518::$$$message_0061_0015_0003$$$::"Okay."::
8519::$$$message_0061_0016_0000$$$::The cultural festival... Outsiders can participate so Saber and Rider can most likely come hang out...[lr]::
8520::$$$message_0061_0016_0001$$$::I bet it would be Illya's first time, so she'll probably make a fuss unless I bring her[line len=2]::
8521::$$$message_0061_0017_0000$$$::"Anyway, that's what it's about.[lr]::
8522::$$$message_0061_0017_0001$$$::I have my own preparations, so I'll ask you to repair the equipment, but I can't keep you company. I'm sorry."[lr]::
8523::$$$message_0061_0017_0002$$$::"It's fine, it's better you attend to your own stuff.[lr]::
8524::$$$message_0061_0017_0003$$$::So, the condition of the heaters that I saw so far..."::
8525::$$$message_0061_0018_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=美綴02c(中) textoff=0]As I'm reporting about the heaters that I checked on, Mitsuzuri is looking over here.::
8526::$$$message_0061_0019_0000$$$::"What, Mitsuzuri?"[lr]::
8527::$$$message_0061_0019_0001$$$::"Well, you've been spacing out even more than usual lately, so I'm worried you might forget once we start preparing."[lr]::
8528::$$$message_0061_0019_0002$$$::"...Mrgh."::
8529::$$$message_0061_0020_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=美綴02a(中) textoff=0]I can't argue back, since I had forgotten about the cultural festival and about being an executive committee member.::
8530::$$$message_0061_0021_0000$$$::"Hm, I see. Your worries are understandable. Emiya, keep me company on the way home. [cacheimage storage=一成01b腕(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成01b腕(中) textoff=0]I shall talk to you about what the cultural festival is then."[lr]::
8531::$$$message_0061_0021_0001$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
8532::$$$message_0061_0021_0002$$$::"Yeah, that's good. Make sure he doesn't forget it for good."[lr]::
8533::$$$message_0061_0021_0003$$$::"Yes. Leave it to me."::
8534::$$$message_0061_0022_0000$$$::"Um, in other words, are you telling me to go home with you today?"[lr]::
8535::$$$message_0061_0022_0001$$$::"Yeah, you don't have work or anything today, right?"[lr]::
8536::$$$message_0061_0022_0002$$$::"I don't. [cacheimage storage=一成01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成01a(中) textoff=0]I wouldn't have come here to help out if I did."::
8537::$$$message_0061_0023_0000$$$::[rep fliplr=0 textoff=0 storages=美綴01b(中),一成02c(中) time=300 flipudr=0 poss=l,r indexes=2000,3000]Mitsuzuri nods, satisfied.[lr]::
8538::$$$message_0061_0023_0001$$$::Well, it shouldn't be like a lecture or anything, and I haven't gone home with Issei lately, so I don't mind...::
8539::$$$message_0061_0024_0000$$$::"...So, why do you seem so happy, Ryudou?"::
8540::$$$message_0061_0025_0000$$$::Yeah. I wondered that too.::
8541::$$$message_0061_0026_0000$$$::"Mrgh, that's not true.[lr]::
8542::$$$message_0061_0026_0001$$$::Well, you're not wrong, but it's because I get to be helpful to Emiya, who I usually cause trouble for[line len=2]"::
8543::$$$message_0061_0027_0000$$$::"All right, all right. I got it.[lr]::
8544::$$$message_0061_0027_0001$$$::So Emiya, can you continue to repair the equipment? Apparently, there's a broken air conditioner that has been left like that in the sports storage. Ryudou and I will continue thinking of our project for the sports clubs.[lr]::
8545::$$$message_0061_0027_0002$$$::The kyudo club hasn't decided on a project idea yet..."::
8546::$$$message_0061_0028_0000$$$::I get kicked out of the student council room.[lr]::
8547::$$$message_0061_0028_0001$$$::...Nothing I can do about it.[lr]::
8548::$$$message_0061_0028_0002$$$::It's past the point of no return, so I'll focus on repairing equipment until Issei is done with his work.::
908476::$$$message_9061_0001_0001$$$::When I open the door, there's Issei and Mitsuzuri inside.[r]::

